       "summary": "Research-only deliverable: plans/agent-view-research.md. Surveyed Claude Code's teammate-view feature (D:/harness-efforts/claude-code/worktrees/main/), codex's existing multi_agents_v2/spawn.rs primitives (READ-ONLY), and happy-app's session-list surface. Decomposed into 6 follow-up tasks tagged spawnedFrom=agent-view-research: agent-tree-rpc, session-parent-link, mobile-tree-view, session-role-pill, spawn-from-app, agent-status-stream. Effort by bucket — (a) codex runtime: 8h; (b) mobile UI: 19h; (c) both: 18h. These follow-ups ARE the Phase 6 'Long-lived teammates' implementation."
